@startuml
title Selection: click a thing, the inspector follows

actor User
participant TimelineView
participant SelectionState
participant TimelineEditor
participant EditorViewModel
participant PropertiesViewModel
participant SectionRegistry

User -> TimelineView : click (clip, effect bar, marker, transition, track)
TimelineView -> SelectionState : Replace(key)  (Shift/Ctrl: Toggle/Add)
note right: an item of another group replaces the\nselection, so the list is always one group
SelectionState --> EditorViewModel : Changed
EditorViewModel -> TimelineEditor : Selected
TimelineEditor -> TimelineEditor : Resolve(each key) -> ISelectable
EditorViewModel -> PropertiesViewModel : Refresh(selected)
PropertiesViewModel -> PropertiesViewModel : shared = AND of every item's Facets
loop each facet in shared
  PropertiesViewModel -> SectionRegistry : Create(facet)
  SectionRegistry --> PropertiesViewModel : InspectorSection
end
PropertiesViewModel --> User : tabs for the shared facets, the first one open

... later: effect bar "level" or "fades" clicked ...
TimelineView -> PropertiesViewModel : OpenSection(Facet.Sound)
@enduml
